{"results":[{"url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=6_94B8mAc-I","title":"Runwal Malabar Hill Mumbai | Ultra Luxury Sea View Apartments","raw_content":"# Runwal Malabar Hill Mumbai | Ultra Luxury Sea View Apartments | Price, Floor Plan & Amenities\n## PropertyCloud \n4850 subscribers\n5 likes\n\n### Description\n326 views\nPosted: 7 Mar 2026\nRunwal Malabar Hill Mumbai | Ultra Luxury Sea View Apartments | Price, Floor Plan & Amenities\n\n📥 Download Runwal Malabar Hill E-Brochure: https://tinyurl.com/23fxch3u\n📥 Request Site Visit & Latest Pricing Details: https://tinyurl.com/23fxch3u\n\n🟢 Key Moments in This Video 🟢\n\n⏱ 0:00 Intro\n⏱ 0:36 Project Introduction\n⏱ 1:20 Project Overview\n⏱ 1:48 Location & Connectivity\n⏱ 2:29 Amenities & Lifestyle\n⏱ 2:50 Configurations & Pricing\n⏱ 4:25 Booking Benefits\n⏱ 4:34 Outro\n\n🏙 Runwal Malabar Hill – Project Overview\n\n✨ Runwal Malabar Hill is an ultra-exclusive luxury residential development located in the prestigious neighbourhood of Walkeshwar, Malabar Hill, South Mumbai.\n\nRising on the iconic Beaulieu Estate (Bafna Bungalow) redevelopment site, this landmark project is designed for a privileged few who seek privacy, sea views, and legacy ownership in one of Mumbai’s most elite addresses.\n\n🌟 Key Highlights\n\n• 🏢 Approx. 40-Storey Luxury Tower\n• ✨ Architecture by Broadway Malyan\n• 🚗 2 Basement Levels for visitor parking\n• 🚘 11 Levels of Podium Car Parking\n• 🏛 Grand Double-Height Entrance Lobby\n• 👨‍✈️ Driver Rooms & Service Facilities\n• 🛗 Dedicated Staff Level with Service Elevator\n• 🟤 Armani Bronze Inspired Facade\n• 👑 Ultra-Limited 14 Exclusive Residences\n\n📍 Location & Connectivity – Walkeshwar, Malabar Hill \n\n🔗 Nearby Landmarks & Travel Time\n\n🛕 Walkeshwar Temple – Approx. 3 mins\n🌊 Girgaon Chowpatty – Approx. 7 mins\n🌴 Marine Drive – Approx. 10 mins\n🏢 Nariman Point – Approx. 12 mins\n🏥 Breach Candy Hospital – Approx. 10 mins\n\n✨ This location offers a rare combination of sea proximity, heritage neighbourhood charm and prime South Mumbai connectivity.\n\n🌿 Amenities & Lifestyle\n\nRunwal Malabar Hill offers a refined luxury lifestyle with thoughtfully designed leisure spaces.\n🏖 Premium Lifestyle Amenities\n\n• 🏛 Double-Height Luxury Clubhouse (22 ft height)\n• 🌅 2500 sq.ft Sky Lounge overlooking Arabian Sea\n• 🍸 Exclusive Leisure & Social Spaces\n• 🧑‍💼 Dedicated Staff Level with Service Access\n• 🔐 High-End Security & Privacy Systems\n• 🛋 Elegant Entrance Lobby & Arrival Experience\n\nThis project creates an ultra-exclusive lifestyle ecosystem rather than just apartments.\n\n🏡 Configurations & Indicative Pricing\n\nThis development offers extremely limited inventory.\n\n👑 Total Residences – Only 14\n🏠 Simplex Residences\n📐 Approx 2500 sq.ft Carpet Area\n🏢 Total 6 Residences\n🏡 Duplex Residences\n📐 Approx 5000 sq.ft Carpet Area\n🏢 Total 8 Residences\n🌊 270° Panoramic Arabian Sea Views\n\n🏠 Configurations & Layout\n\n✨ The project offers ultra-luxury limited edition residences designed for spacious living, privacy, and breathtaking sea views.\n\n🏡 Simplex Residences\n\n• 📐 Approx 2500 sq.ft Carpet Area\n• 🏠 Total: 6 Exclusive Residences\n\n🏡 Duplex Residences\n\n• 📐 Approx 5000 sq.ft Carpet Area\n• 🏠 Total: 8 Exclusive Residences\n\n\n💰 Pricing\n• 💵 ₹1.3 Lakh per sq.ft onwards\n\n📅 Possession Timeline\n\n🗓 Internal Target Possession: June 2030\n📜 RERA Possession Timeline: June 2032\n\n📈 2030 Investment Perspective\n\nMalabar Hill is one of Mumbai’s most supply-constrained ultra-luxury markets.\n\nRedevelopment opportunities here are extremely rare, making projects like Runwal Malabar Hill highly valuable.\n\n⭐ Why This Project Stands Out\n• 👑 Only 14 Exclusive Residences\n• 📍 Prestigious Malabar Hill Address\n• 🌊 270° Arabian Sea Views\n• 🏗 Architecture by Broadway Malyan\n• 🏙 Rare South Mumbai Redevelopment Project\n• 💼 Designed for HNIs & UHNIs\n\n📝 Booking & Enquiry Process\nDuring Site Visit:\n\n1️⃣ Detailed Project Presentation\n2️⃣ Residence Pricing & Payment Plan Discussion\n3️⃣ Layout & Sea View Orientation\n4️⃣ Booking & Documentation Assistance\n⚠️ Limited inventory available.\n\n🤝 Need Help Buying Luxury Property?\n\n📲 WhatsApp: https://tinyurl.com/23fxch3u\n🔵 Facebook: https://www.facebook.com/profile.php?id=100063863267887\n📸 Instagram: https://www.instagram.com/propertycloud.in\n💼 LinkedIn: https://www.linkedin.com/company/property-cloud-realty-specifier/\n©️ PropertyCloud Realty Specifier Private Limited\n\n\n### Transcript:\nहाय एवरीवन, मैं हूं रोशनी और आप देख रहे हो प्रॉपर्टी क्लाउड। आज हम बात करने वाले हैं साउथ मुंबई के एक अल्ट्रा एक्सक्लूसिव लग्जरी रेजिडेंशियल डेवलपमेंट के बारे में। अगर आप मालाबार हिल या वालकेश्वर जैसे प्रेस्टीजियस एड्रेस में सीबीयू लग्जरी रेजिडेंसेस एक्सप्लोर कर रहे हो। तो ये आज का प्रोजेक्ट आपको डेफिनेटली काफी अच्छा लगेगा। क्योंकि इस वीडियो में हम डिस्कस करेंगे प्रोजेक्ट का ओवरव्यू, लोकेशन एडवांटेजेस, इमिनिटीज, प्राइिंग, बुकिंग ऑफर्स, रेजिडेंशियल कॉन्फ़िगरेशन और सबसे इंपॉर्टेंट पार्ट एक्सक्लूसिविटी और लेगसी वैल्यू। तो चलिए शुरू करते हैं। अगर आप मलाबार हिल जैसे आइकॉनिक एड्रेस पर एक रेयर लग्जरी रेजिडेंसेस सर्च कर रहे हो जहां प्राइवेसी हो, सीवयू हो और लिमिटेड इन्वेंटरी हो तो यह प्रोजेक्ट आपके लिए एक रेयर ओपोरर्चुनिटी हो सकता है। आज हम फीचर कर रहे हैं रणवाल मलाबार हिल वालकेश्वर। यह डेवलपमेंट राइज हो रहा है आइकॉनिक बलो स्टेट साइट पर जो साउथ मुंबई के सबसे कोविटेड रीडवलपमेंट लोकेशन में से एक माना जाता है और प्रोजेक्ट स्पेशली डिजाइन किया गया है सिर्फ प्रिविलेज्ड प्योर रेजिडेंसेस के लिए। अगर हम प्रोजेक्ट के स्केल और आर्किटेक्चर की बात करें तो रणवाल मालाबार हिल एक आइकॉनिक हाई राइज लग्जरी टावर होने वाला है। क्योंकि टावर का आर्किटेक्चर डिजाइन किया गया है इंटरनेशनल आर्किटेक्चर फर्म ब्रॉडवे मालियान के द्वारा। प्रोजेक्ट में होगा अप्रोक्स 40 फ्लोर्स का लग्जरी टावर जो मालाबार हिल स्काई लाइन को रिीडफाइन करेगा। इंफ्रास्ट्रक्चर भी काफी थॉटफुली प्लान है। जैसे टू बेसमेंट लेवल्स फॉर विजिटर पार्किंग, ड्राइवर रूम एंड सर्विस फैसिलिटीज, ग्रैंड डबल हाइट एंटेनेंस लॉबी, 11 लेवल पोडियम कार पार्किंग और सीमलेस लिफ्ट एक्सेस फॉर रेजिडेंस। अब बात करते हैं लोकेशन की। तो ऑनेस्टली साउथ मुंबई रियल स्टेट में लोकेशन ही सबसे बड़ा फैक्टर होता है। रनवाल मालाबार हिल लोकेटेड है डोंगर सी रोड वालकेश्वर मालाबार हिल में। यह एरिया साउथ मुंबई के सबसे प्रेस्टीजियस नेबरहुड्स में से एक है। नियर बाय लैंडमार्क में आपको मिल जाता है बालकेश्वर टेंपल जो बस 3 मिनट के डिस्टेंस पर है। गिरगांव चौपाटी है बस 7 मिनट के डिस्टेंस पर। मरीन ड्राइव आपको मिल जाता है बस 10 मिनट पर। नरिमन पॉइंट मिलता है 12 मिनट्स पर। रिच कैंडी हॉस्पिटल आता है बस 10 मिनट के डिस्टेंस पर। मतलब यहां रेजिडेंस को मिलता है सी प्रॉक्सिमिटी हेरिटेज नेबरहुड और प्राइम कनेक्टिविटी। और अगर लाइफस्टाइल पर्सपेक्टिव से भी देखें तो प्रोजेक्ट काफी प्रीमियम है। रेजिडेंट्स के लिए प्लान है डबल हाइट लग्जरी क्लब हाउस, अरेबियन सी प्लेसिंग स्काई लाउंच, प्रीमियम लेजर इम्यूनिटीज, हाई एंड सिक्योरिटी और प्राइवेसी फीचर्स। मतलब यह प्रोजेक्ट सिर्फ अपार्टमेंट ही नहीं बल्कि एक एक्सक्लूसिव लग्जरी लाइफस्टाइल इकोसिस्टम क्रिएट करता है। कॉन्फ़िगरेशंस की अगर बात करें तो सिंपलेक रेजिडेंसेस स्टार्ट होते हैं अप्रोक्सिममेटली 2500 स्क्वायर फीट के कारपेट एरिया के साथ जो है बस छह रेजिडेंसेस। डुप्लेक रेजिडेंसेस की बात करें तो ये शुरू होते हैं 5000 स्क्वायर फीट से जिसमें है बस आर्ट रेजिडेंसेस और सबसे इंप्रेसिव फीचर 270° का पैनारोमिक अरेबियन सी व्यू जो हर अपार्टमेंट को एक रेयर लग्जरी एक्सपीरियंस बनाते हैं। एक्सपेक्टेड प्राइिंग है अप्रोक्स 1.3 लाख पर स्क्वायर मीटर ऑन व्स। और अगर हम बात करें पजेशन के टाइमलाइन की तो इंटरनल टारगेट पोजीशन एक्सपेक्टेड है बाय जून 2030 और रेरा पोजेशन टाइमलाइन है जून 2032 अगर इन्वेस्टमेंट पॉइंट ऑफ व्यू से देखा जाए तो मलाबार हिल हिस्टोरिकली लिमिटेड सप्लाई मार्केट में रहा है। यहां रीडेडवलपमेंट ओपोरर्चुनिटीज एक्सट्रीमली रेयर होती है और इसी वजह से अल्ट्रा लग्जरी डिमांड स्ट्रांग रहता है। लेकिन इस प्रोजेक्ट में आपको मिलते हैं लिमिटेड इन्वेंटरी, आइकॉनिक लोकेशन, प्रीमियम आर्किटेक्चर और ये तीनों फैक्टर्स मिलाकर लॉन्ग टर्म कैपिटल अप्रिसिएशन पोटेंशियल को स्ट्रांग बनाते हैं। तो फिलहाल रनवाल, मालाबार हिल, मालकेश्वर में लिमिटेड रेजिडेंसेस अवेलेबल है। अगर आप प्राइसिंग, ब्रोशर या प्राइवेट साइट विजिट डिटेल्स चाहते हो तो डिस्क्रिप्शन में दिया गया लिंक आप जरूर चेक करें। मैं हूं रोशनी। आप देख रहे हो प्रॉपर्टी क्लाउड। ऐसी ही और प्रीमियम रियलस्टेट प्रोजेक्ट अपडेट्स के लिए प्रॉपर्टी क्लाउड को सब्सक्राइब करना मत भूलना। प्रॉपर्टी क्लाउड एक प्रॉपटे कंपनी है जो आपको डायरेक्टली कनेक्ट करती है डेवलपर्स के साथ। आपके होमबाइंड प्रोसेस को एकदम इजी करने के लिए। उसी के साथ आपको यहां मिलते हैं कई सारे बेनिफिट्स जैसे स्पॉट डिस्काउंट, जीरो ब्रोकरेज, फ्री पिकअप एंड ड्रॉप सर्विसेस और भी बहुत कुछ।","images":[]},{"url":"https://propertybutler.in/insights/sambhav-primordial-house-malabar-hill-review-2026","title":"Sambhav Primordial House — Malabar Hill Building Review 2026: Price, Verdict and Who It's For | Property Butler","raw_content":"[Skip to content](#main-content)\n\n\n[![Property Butler](/logo.png)\n\nPROPERTYBUTLER](/)\n\n[WhatsApp Advisor](https://wa.me/918433511885?text=Hi%2C%20looking%20for%20a%20property%20in%20Mumbai%20%E2%80%94%20can%20you%20help%3F)\n\n\n\n3 May 2026 · 8 min read\n\n# Sambhav Primordial House — Malabar Hill Building Review 2026: Price, Verdict and Who It's For\n\n# Sambhav Primordial House — Malabar Hill Building Review 2026: Price, Verdict and Who It’s For\n\nSambhav Primordial House at Walkeshwar, Malabar Hill sits at the intersection of two narratives — the boutique developer play in Mumbai’s most aspirational address, and a per-sqft asking of **₹54,209/sqft** that positions it significantly below the Aurum Girnar benchmark (₹1,28,217/sqft) in the same micro-market. Property Butler tracks one listing from this project in our inventory (RERA: P51900010963, asking ₹5.24–10.40 Cr). This review gives you the full picture — project specifics, location dynamics, Walkeshwar micro-market context, comparable buildings, and an honest assessment of who Sambhav Primordial House makes sense for in 2026.\n\nSambhav Primordial House — Property Butler Data Snapshot\n\nP51900010963\n\nRERA registration\n\n₹54,209/sqft\n\nAverage asking PSF\n\n₹5.24–10.40 Cr\n\nListing price range\n\nUnder Construction\n\nProject status\n\n## Location — Why Walkeshwar Is Not Just “Malabar Hill”\n\nWalkeshwar is the old-money core of Malabar Hill — the area between the ancient Walkeshwar Temple, Banganga Tank, and the cliff edge overlooking Back Bay. Unlike the Pedder Road end of Malabar Hill (which is busier and more accessible), Walkeshwar has a distinct quality: it is quieter, more secluded, and retains a heritage residential character that even Malabar Hill’s own broader canopy cannot fully claim. The streets here are narrow, the buildings are set back from the road, and the density is low. Sambhav Primordial House sits in this pocket, commanding the Walkeshwar address at a PSF that reflects boutique developer scale rather than Lodha or Birla pricing power.\n\nThe critical view consideration: Sambhav Primordial House’s upper floors have partial or full views of the Banganga Tank complex and the cliff-facing Back Bay. These are among Mumbai’s most unusual residential views — a heritage water tank and the colonial-era marine landscape — and they command a premium that pure sea-facing PSF comparisons (which favour towers at Worli Sea Face or Cuffe Parade) do not fully capture.\n\n## Project Details and Configuration\n\nSambhav Group is a smaller developer operating in Mumbai’s boutique luxury segment. The Primordial House project is a low-unit-count building — Property Butler tracks one unit in our active inventory — which is consistent with the Walkeshwar development pattern: boutique buildings of 12–30 units on individual plots, not large-tower projects. This creates both a premium (exclusivity, no shared amenity costs diluted across hundreds of units) and a risk (smaller developer track record, less institutional backing, longer construction periods).\n\nThe project’s RERA registration P51900010963 is verifiable on the Maharashtra RERA portal (maharera.mahaonline.gov.in). Property Butler advises all buyers to verify: (1) RERA-committed possession date; (2) current construction stage versus RERA milestone schedule; (3) whether the developer has drawn any funds from the RERA escrow account beyond permitted stages. Small boutique developers on Malabar Hill have a mixed track record on construction pace — a completed, OC-received unit is worth a significant premium over an under-construction unit from the same developer.\n\n## The 57.7% PSF Discount vs Aurum Girnar — What It Means\n\nThe starkest data point in Property Butler’s Walkeshwar comparison: Sambhav Primordial House at ₹54,209/sqft sits 57.7% below Aurum Girnar at ₹1,28,217/sqft. Both are under-construction boutique buildings in the Malabar Hill / Walkeshwar micro-market. What explains the gap?\n\n* **Developer brand premium:** Aurum Real Estate Developers Limited has a stronger brand recognition in the luxury segment than Sambhav Group. Brand premium on Malabar Hill can account for 20–40% of the PSF difference.\n* **Unit mix and scale:** Aurum Girnar has 30 units (3–4 BHK, 1,055–2,228 sqft carpet) — a more conventional luxury product. Sambhav’s smaller scale and unit count suggests either a lower specification or a different buyer positioning.\n* **View and floor premiums:** Aurum Girnar’s upper floors (the ₹1.28L PSF units) are sea-facing. Sambhav’s views are heritage-facing but not directly sea-facing — a view that commands a premium in the connoisseur segment but a discount in the mainstream luxury market.\n* **Construction completion risk:** A boutique developer asking ₹54,000/sqft under construction is offering a very different risk-return profile from an established developer at ₹1.28L/sqft. The discount may partly reflect the construction risk premium demanded by the market.\n\n| Parameter | Sambhav Primordial House | Aurum Girnar | Satellite Sesen |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| Developer | Sambhav Group | Aurum Real Estate | Satellite Developers |\n| RERA | P51900010963 | P51900080926 | Verify on portal |\n| Avg asking PSF | ₹54,209 | ₹1,28,217 | ₹55,000–75,000 (est.) |\n| Total asking range | ₹5.24–10.40 Cr | ₹29.49 Cr+ | ₹10–25 Cr (est.) |\n| Configuration | As per RERA filing | 3–4 BHK, 1,055–2,228 sqft carpet | Boutique, small count |\n| Property Butler Trust Score | 60/100 (B) | 55/100 (C+) | Verify |\n\n## Who Sambhav Primordial House Makes Sense For\n\nThis is the most important question, and it depends entirely on what you are optimising for. Sambhav Primordial House makes sense for a buyer who: (1) wants a Malabar Hill / Walkeshwar address at under ₹60,000/sqft, which is otherwise unavailable in new construction here; (2) values the heritage and cultural significance of the Banganga-Walkeshwar Temple micro-pocket over pure sea-facing premium; (3) has appetite for boutique developer risk and is able to closely monitor RERA milestones; (4) is in the ₹5–12 Cr budget range and wants a Malabar Hill new-launch rather than a resale in an older society building.\n\nIt does NOT make sense for buyers who: (1) need RERA-guaranteed possession certainty on a specific date; (2) require institutional developer brand for external validation (family approval, NRI family members who associate Malabar Hill with established developer names only); (3) are comparing it to RTM resale options at similar PSF — at ₹54,000/sqft, there are Malabar Hill resale options in society buildings that deliver immediate possession, no GST, and no construction timeline risk.\n\n## Due Diligence Checklist for Sambhav Primordial House Buyers\n\n1. **Verify RERA status online:** Check P51900010963 on maharera.mahaonline.gov.in. Verify committed possession date, current construction stage, quarterly progress reports, and whether the project has any complaints filed against it.\n2. **Developer track record check:** Request Sambhav Group’s completed project list. For each completed project, verify: were possession dates met? Were OCs delivered? Are there any NCLT or consumer court complaints?\n3. **Title and land:** Verify the land on which Sambhav Primordial House is being built is free of litigation, government acquisition proceedings, or disputed ownership. The Walkeshwar area has some historically complex land holdings.\n4. **GST planning:** Under-construction means 5% GST applies on agreement value. Budget ₹26–52 lakh additional on a ₹5.24–10.40 Cr purchase. This cost disappears if/when you buy RTM-equivalent resale at the same PSF.\n5. **Floor and unit selection:** Verify which specific floor and orientation delivers the Banganga or back-bay views. Property Butler recommends requesting a floor plan with view analysis before committing.\n\n## Frequently Asked Questions\n\nWhat is the expected possession date for Sambhav Primordial House?\n\nThe committed possession date is available on the RERA portal under registration P51900010963. Property Butler advises verifying this directly on maharera.mahaonline.gov.in rather than relying on marketing materials. Small developers on Malabar Hill have historically taken 12–24 months beyond the RERA date to complete projects — factor this into your decision if you need possession by a specific date.\n\n  Is Sambhav Primordial House better than buying a resale flat on Malabar Hill at ₹55,000/sqft?\n\nThe resale option at ₹55,000/sqft offers immediate possession, no GST (if RTM), and no construction timeline risk — but requires thorough due diligence on OC, structural condition, and society health, which takes 60–90 days. Sambhav Primordial House offers the credibility of RERA registration and new construction quality — but adds 5% GST, construction timeline uncertainty, and boutique developer execution risk. For buyers who can manage resale due diligence, a well-selected resale at similar PSF is typically the better risk-adjusted choice. For buyers who lack the capacity or contacts for resale due diligence, a RERA-registered new launch removes that complexity at a cost.\n\n  Can an NRI buy Sambhav Primordial House?\n\nYes. NRIs and OCIs can buy under-construction properties in India, subject to FEMA payment routing rules (NRE/NRO/FCNR accounts only, as described in the NRI buyer guide). The 5% GST on under-construction applies to NRI buyers identically to resident buyers. The RERA consumer protection — interest at SBI MCLR + 2% on delayed possession — protects NRI buyers just as it protects residents. Property Butler’s NRI advisory team has managed FEMA compliance for Walkeshwar and Malabar Hill under-construction purchases previously.\n\n  How does Sambhav Primordial House compare to Lodha Altamount (Pedder Road)?\n\nLodha Altamount on Altamount Road / Pedder Road is a different tier entirely — Lodha brand, much larger project, PSF significantly higher than Sambhav’s ₹54,209. Altamount Road targets the ₹25–100 Cr buyer; Sambhav Primordial House at ₹5–10 Cr targets a materially different budget segment. The address comparison is also different: Altamount Road has the “Antilia street” cachet and is more accessible by car; Walkeshwar has heritage resonance and temple proximity. Both are within 1.5 km of each other but serve distinct buyer profiles and price points.\n\nInterested in Sambhav Primordial House or Other Malabar Hill Options?\n\nProperty Butler can arrange a site visit to Sambhav Primordial House and provide a comparative analysis against Aurum Girnar, Satellite Sesen, and the best resale options at similar PSF in the Walkeshwar micro-market.\n\n[View Malabar Hill New Launches](/search?q=new+launch+Malabar+Hill+Walkeshwar)\n\nRelated Reading\n\n[→ Malabar Hill Property Guide 2026 — Complete Buyer Reference](/insights/malabar-hill-property-guide-2026) [→ Malabar Hill Penthouse and Ultra-Luxury Guide 2026](/insights/malabar-hill-penthouse-ultra-luxury-guide-2026) [→ Malabar Hill NRI Buyer’s Complete Playbook 2026](/insights/malabar-hill-nri-buyer-guide-2026) [→ Malabar Hill Resale Apartment Buying Guide 2026](/insights/malabar-hill-resale-apartment-buying-guide-2026) [→ Lodha Altamount Malabar Hill Review 2026](/insights/lodha-altamount-malabar-hill-review-2026) [→ Browse All Malabar Hill Properties](/area/malabar-hill)\n\nProperty Butler · Reply within 30 min\n\n### Buying in Malabar Hill? Talk to a Property Butler advisor\n\nWe track every active listing in Malabar Hill. Drop your number — we reply within 30 min on WhatsApp.\n\n[![Prithvi Shah](/api/team-photo/prithvi-shah)Prithvi Shah · Managing PartnerNegotiation and closing across MumbaiWhatsApp →](https://wa.me/919833617754?text=Hi%20Prithvi%2C%20I%20have%20a%20question%20about%20a%20Mumbai%20property.)\n\nRead Next\n\n[### Lodha Malabar Malabar Hill — Complete Review 2026: Prices, Configurations, Sea vs Garden View & Who Should Buy\n\nLodha Malabar on Ridge Road is one of the most significant luxury projects on Malabar Hill — 3 BHK from Rs 18 Cr to penthouse above Rs 100 Cr. Sea-facing and garden-facing units. OC received and fully occupied. Property Butler's standalone 2026 review.\n\n19 May 2026](/insights/lodha-malabar-malabar-hill-complete-review-2026)[### Kalpataru Azuro Malabar Hill — Complete Buyer Guide 2026: Pricing, Configurations & How It Compares to Seamont and Runwal Malabar\n\nKalpataru Azuro on Malabar Hill asks Rs 1.25–1.34 lakh PSF for 3–4 BHK under construction (possession 2027–2028). It is Kalpataru's third Malabar Hill project. Property Butler's complete buyer guide with pricing, comparison to alternatives, and due diligence checklist.\n\n19 May 2026](/insights/kalpataru-azuro-malabar-hill-buyer-guide-2026)[### Aurum Girnar Walkeshwar Review 2026 — Six Sky Residences, ₹29 Crore and the Malabar Hill Ultra-Niche\n\nJust 6 Sky Residences on floors 17–33 at Walkeshwar, starting ₹29.49 Cr (~₹1.28L/sqft, +35% above Malabar Hill average). Property Butler full review: price anatomy, view geometry, Aurum Seven comparison, due-diligence checklist, and buyer-profile verdict.\n\n11 May 2026](/insights/aurum-girnar-malabar-hill-complete-review-2026)\n\n[Browse all stories →](/insights)\n\nNeed help with a specific Mumbai property?\n\n[WhatsApp our advisor](https://wa.me/918433511885?text=Hi%2C%20I%20read%20your%20article%20and%20I%27m%20interested%20in%20Mumbai%20properties)\n\n[Call](tel:+919321637065)","images":[]},{"url":"https://runwalmalabar-hill.in","title":"Runwal Malabar Hill | Duplex at Mumbai","raw_content":"* [Floor Plan](#configration_floor_plan)\n* [Price](#configration_floor_plan)\n* [Gallery](#gallery)\n\n![Runwal Malabar Hill  Banner](https://runwalmalabar-hill.in/public/admin/images/1772109807.jpg)\n\n![Runwal Malabar Hill  Banner](https://runwalmalabar-hill.in/public/admin/images/1772109816.jpg)\n\nMahaRERA Website\n\n [maharera.maharashtra.gov.in](https://maharera.maharashtra.gov.in/) \n\nProject MahaRERA No.\n\n [![PR1170002502441](https://runwalmalabar-hill.in/public/admin/images/qr/Runwal-Malabar-Hill-QR-PR1170002502441_-26022026125452.png)](javascript:void(0);)\n\nProject MahaRERA No.\n\n [![A51700026634](https://runwalmalabar-hill.in/public/admin/images/qr/A51700026634.png)](javascript:void(0);)\n\nProject MahaRERA No. PR1170002502441\n\n[![PR1170002502441](https://runwalmalabar-hill.in/public/admin/images/qr/Runwal-Malabar-Hill-QR-PR1170002502441_-26022026125452.png)](javascript:void(0);)\n\nProject MahaRERA No. A51700026634\n\n[![A51700026634](https://runwalmalabar-hill.in/public/admin/images/qr/A51700026634.png)](javascript:void(0);)\n\n![Runwal Malabar Hill  Banner](https://runwalmalabar-hill.in/public/admin/images/1772109807.jpg)\n\n![Runwal Malabar Hill  Banner](https://runwalmalabar-hill.in/public/admin/images/1772109816.jpg)\n\nFor Best Offers Fill Your Details\n\n![Runwal Realty Developer](https://runwalmalabar-hill.in/public/admin/images/1678871226.svg)\n\nRunwal Realty\n\nDeveloper\n\n![Malabar Hills, Mumbai Location](https://runwalmalabar-hill.in/public/admin/images/1678871255.svg)\n\nMalabar Hills, Mumbai\n\nLocation\n\n# About Runwal Malabar Hill Project\n\n**Runwal Malabar Hill** is a Project by **Runwal Realty** situated in the most premium location of **Mumbai**, Malabar Hill, NEXT TO THE GOVERNOR’S ESTATE offers  **Duplex** Apartment . Also get Floor Plan, Price Sheet, RERA ID, Reviews, Possession Timeline, Construction Status, Location Advantages, Address, Amenities & Specifications. Runwal Realty Runwal Malabar Mumbai is an Exclusive Premium Tower of **G + 34** **Storey**. Runwal Malabar Hill Runwal Realty Mumbai Property Features **Amenities** like Serene Infinity Pool, Sunlit Sundeck, Tranquil Jacuzzi, Ice Lounge, Gymnasium, Private Business Suite, Grand Arrival Lobby, Private Drop‑Off And Three‑Sided, Verdant Landscape, The Jacuzzi. Runwal Malabar Hill  Has **Excellent Connectivity** Wilson College - 4 Mins, DSB International School - 9 Mins, Hill Spring International School - 10 Mins, Jai Hind College - 12 Mins, The Malabar Hill Club - 4 Mins, Breach Candy Club - 8 Mins, The Taj Mahal Palace - 12 Mins, St. Regis - 14 Mins, Wankhede Stadium - 8 Mins, Mahalaxmi Race Course - 10 Mins, Atria Mall - 12 Mins, Walkeshwar Jain Temple - 2 Mins, Babulnath Temple - 4 Mins, ITC - 16 Mins.\n\nMalabar Hill is well-connected to Worli, Nariman Point, Colaba, Bandra, Churchgate.\n\n**Runwal Realty** has many ongoing, upcoming & completed Projects Runwal Anthurium - Mulund, Runwal Mycity - Dombivli East, The Residence -  Nepean Sea Road, Runwal Elegante - Andheri West, The Reserve - Worli, Nirvana By - Parel.\n\n![Runwal Malabar Hill _ Elevation Image](https://runwalmalabar-hill.in/public/admin/images/image1772109735.jpg)\n\n## Runwal Malabar Hill Overview\n\n![Project Name](https://runwalmalabar-hill.in/public/admin/images/image1729333292.svg)\n\nProject Name\n\nRunwal Malabar Hill\n\n![Location](https://runwalmalabar-hill.in/public/admin/images/image1729333246.svg)\n\nLocation\n\nMalabar Hill, Mumbai\n\n![Developer Name](https://runwalmalabar-hill.in/public/admin/images/image1729333232.svg)\n\nDeveloper Name\n\nRunwal Realty\n\n![TOTAL TOWERS](https://runwalmalabar-hill.in/public/admin/images/image1678871433.svg)\n\nTOTAL TOWERS\n\n1\n\n![FLOORS](https://runwalmalabar-hill.in/public/admin/images/image1678871419.svg)\n\nFLOORS\n\nG + 34 Storey\n\n![APARTMENTS](https://runwalmalabar-hill.in/public/admin/images/image1678871403.svg)\n\nAPARTMENTS\n\nDuplex Apartment\n\n![AREA](https://runwalmalabar-hill.in/public/admin/images/image1678871390.svg)\n\nAREA\n\n5000 Sqft\n\n![POSSESSION](https://runwalmalabar-hill.in/public/admin/images/image1678871368.svg)\n\nPOSSESSION\n\nUnder Construction\n\n![RESEDENTIAL](https://runwalmalabar-hill.in/public/admin/images/image1678871349.svg)\n\nRESEDENTIAL\n\nProperty\n\n## Runwal Malabar Hill Property Specification\n\n|  |\n| --- |\n| Designed by Broadway Malyan |\n| Armani Bronze Facade |\n| Grand double-height lobby |\n| Two basements + dedicated staff level (L1with separate service elevator access) |\n| 11 parking bays (approx. 2500 sq.ft) |\n| Double-height clubhouse (22 ft) |\n| 2500 sq.ft Sky Lounge with amenities overlooking the Arabian Sea |\n\n## Configuration & Price Of Runwal Malabar Hill\n\n| Type | Carpet Area (sq ft) | Price |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n|\n| Duplex Apartment | 5000 Sqft | Call for Price |\n\n## Runwal Malabar Hill Floor Plan\n\n## Runwal Malabar Hill Gallery\n\n### Elevation Images\n\n![Runwal-Malabar-Hill-Banner-2](https://runwalmalabar-hill.in/public/admin/images/Runwal-Malabar-Hill-Banner-2-26022026125011.jpg)\n\nRunwal-Malabar-Hill-Banner-2\n\n![Runwal-Malabar-Hill-Banner-1](https://runwalmalabar-hill.in/public/admin/images/Runwal-Malabar-Hill-Banner-1-26022026125024.jpg)\n\nRunwal-Malabar-Hill-Banner-1\n\n![Runwal-Malabar-Hill-Actual-View](https://runwalmalabar-hill.in/public/admin/images/Runwal-Malabar-Hill-Actual-View-26022026125210.jpg)\n\nRunwal-Malabar-Hill-Actual-View\n\n![Runwal-Malabar-Hill-Actual-View](https://runwalmalabar-hill.in/public/admin/images/Runwal-Malabar-Hill-Actual View-26022026125223.jpg)\n\nRunwal-Malabar-Hill-Actual-View\n\n![Runwal-Malabar-Hill-About-Us](https://runwalmalabar-hill.in/public/admin/images/Runwal-Malabar-Hill-About-Us-26022026125256.jpg)\n\nRunwal-Malabar-Hill-About-Us\n\n### Sample Flat Photos\n\n![Runwal-Malabar-Hill-Internal-Gallery-Sovereign-Lounge](https://runwalmalabar-hill.in/public/admin/images/Runwal-Malabar-Hill-Internal-Gallery-Sovereign-Lounge-26022026124858.jpg)\n\nRunwal-Malabar-Hill-Internal-Gallery-Sovereign-Lounge\n\n![Runwal-Malabar-Hill-Internal-Gallery-Kitchen](https://runwalmalabar-hill.in/public/admin/images/Runwal-Malabar-Hill-Internal-Gallery-Kitchen-26022026124914.jpg)\n\nRunwal-Malabar-Hill-Internal-Gallery-Kitchen\n\n![Runwal-Malabar-Hill-Internal-Gallery-Washroom](https://runwalmalabar-hill.in/public/admin/images/Runwal-Malabar-Hill-Internal-Gallery-Washroom-26022026124928.jpg)\n\nRunwal-Malabar-Hill-Internal-Gallery-Washroom\n\n![Runwal-Malabar-Hill-Internal-Gallery-Deck](https://runwalmalabar-hill.in/public/admin/images/Runwal-Malabar-Hill-Internal-Gallery-Deck-26022026124941.jpg)\n\nRunwal-Malabar-Hill-Internal-Gallery-Deck\n\n![Runwal-Malabar-Hill-Internal-Gallery](https://runwalmalabar-hill.in/public/admin/images/Runwal-Malabar-Hill-Internal-Gallery-26022026124955.jpg)\n\nRunwal-Malabar-Hill-Internal-Gallery\n\n![Runwal-Malabar-Hill-Amenities-The-Pavilion-Suite](https://runwalmalabar-hill.in/public/admin/images/Runwal-Malabar-Hill-Amenities-The-Pavilion-Suite-26022026125040.jpg)\n\nRunwal-Malabar-Hill-Amenities-The-Pavilion-Suite\n\n![Runwal-Malabar-Hill-Amenities-The-Gymnasium](https://runwalmalabar-hill.in/public/admin/images/Runwal-Malabar-Hill-Amenities-The-Gymnasium-26022026125055.jpg)\n\nRunwal-Malabar-Hill-Amenities-The-Gymnasium\n\n![Runwal-Malabar-Hill-Amenities-Swimming-Pool](https://runwalmalabar-hill.in/public/admin/images/Runwal-Malabar-Hill-Amenities-Swimming-Pool-26022026125110.jpg)\n\nRunwal-Malabar-Hill-Amenities-Swimming-Pool\n\n![Runwal-Malabar-Hill-Amenities-Entrance](https://runwalmalabar-hill.in/public/admin/images/Runwal-Malabar-Hill-Amenities-Entrance-26022026125126.jpg)\n\nRunwal-Malabar-Hill-Amenities-Entrance\n\n![Runwal-Malabar-Hill-Amenities-Drop-Off-Lobby](https://runwalmalabar-hill.in/public/admin/images/Runwal-Malabar-Hill-Amenities-Drop-Off-Lobby-26022026125142.jpg)\n\nRunwal-Malabar-Hill-Amenities-Drop-Off-Lobby\n\n![Runwal-Malabar-Hill-Amenities-2-Level-Clubhouse](https://runwalmalabar-hill.in/public/admin/images/Runwal-Malabar-Hill-Amenities-2-Level-Clubhouse-26022026125156.jpg)\n\nRunwal-Malabar-Hill-Amenities-2-Level-Clubhouse\n\n![Runwal-Malabar-Hill](https://runwalmalabar-hill.in/public/admin/images/Runwal-Malabar-Hill-26022026125240.jpg)\n\nRunwal-Malabar-Hill\n\n#### External Amenities\n\n* Serene Infinity Pool\n* Sunlit Sundeck\n* Tranquil Jacuzzi\n* Ice Lounge\n* Gymnasium\n* Private Business Suite\n* Grand Arrival Lobby\n* Private Drop‑Off And Three‑Sided\n* Verdant Landscape\n* The Jacuzzi\n\n#### Internal Features\n\n* Marble‑Clad Private Lobbies\n* Granite Staircases\n* Designer Tiles In Lift Lobbies\n* Private Elevator And Private Lobby\n* Flexible Outhouse Space\n* Integrated Within The Residence\n\n## Runwal Malabar Hill Walkthrough Video\n\n![https://www.youtube.com/embed/sTXxEveA_Yw](//i.ytimg.com/vi_webp/sTXxEveA_Yw/maxresdefault.webp)\n\n![https://www.youtube.com/embed/sTXxEveA_Yw](//i.ytimg.com/vi_webp/sTXxEveA_Yw/maxresdefault.webp)\n\n![image](https://runwalmalabar-hill.in/public/admin/images/Runwal-Developer-favicon_-26022026125357.png)\n\n## Runwal Realty\n\nRunwal Realty is a prominent Indian real estate development company that's been around since 1978. With over 45 years of experience, they've built a reputation for delivering high-quality residential, commercial, and retail projects. The company, founded by Subhash Runwal, is now led by his son Sandeep Runwal, who has expanded their portfolio with luxurious projects like Runwal Malabar and Runwal The Residence. Runwal Realty has completed over 50 projects, serving more than 48,000 families, and is known for its focus on quality, sustainability, and customer satisfaction\n\n### Enquire Now\n\n### Runwal Malabar Hill Construction Status\n\n## Runwal Malabar Hill Location\n\n## Runwal Malabar Hill Sales Gallery / Office Address & Experience Center\n\nRunwal Malabar Hill, Dongarsi Road, Teen Batti, Malabar Hill, Mumbai, Maharashtra 400006.\n\n## Runwal Malabar Hill MahaRera\n\n[![PR1170002502441](https://runwalmalabar-hill.in/public/admin/images/qr/Runwal-Malabar-Hill-QR-PR1170002502441_-26022026125452.png)](javascript:void(0);) \n\nPR1170002502441\n\nThe website project is registered under  [maharera.maharashtra.gov.in](https://maharera.maharashtra.gov.in/)\n\n## Frequently Asked Question\n\n[What types of homes are available at Runwal Malabar Hill?](#collapse0)\n\nRunwal Malabar Hill offers Duplex Apartment Carpet 5000 Sqft.\n\n[What amenities are provided at Runwal Malabar Hill?](#collapse1)\n\nThe project includes over 25 amenities such as a Serene Infinity Pool, Sunlit Sundeck, Tranquil Jacuzzi, Ice Lounge, Gymnasium, Private Business Suite, Grand Arrival Lobby, Private Drop‑Off And Three‑Sided, Verdant Landscape, The Jacuzzi and more.\n\n[What is the location advantage of Runwal Malabar Hill?](#collapse2)\n\nLocated Nearby Wilson College - 4 Mins, DSB International School - 9 Mins, Hill Spring International School - 10 Mins, Jai Hind College - 12 Mins, The Malabar Hill Club - 4 Mins, Breach Candy Club - 8 Mins, The Taj Mahal Palace - 12 Mins, St. Regis - 14 Mins, Wankhede Stadium - 8 Mins, Mahalaxmi Race Course - 10 Mins, Atria Mall - 12 Mins, Walkeshwar Jain Temple - 2 Mins, Babulnath Temple - 4 Mins, ITC - 16 Mins, the property offers excellent connectivity.\n\n[Is Runwal Malabar Hill, a RERA-registered project?](#collapse3)\n\nYes, Runwal Malabar Hill is an RERA-authorized project with MahaRERA number PR1170002502441.\n\n[![Runwal Malabar Hill ](https://runwalmalabar-hill.in/public/admin/images/qr/A51700026634.png)](https://maharerait.maharashtra.gov.in/agent/view/40583) \n\n[![Runwal Malabar Hill ](https://runwalmalabar-hill.in/public/admin/images/qr/A51700026634.png)](https://maharerait.maharashtra.gov.in/agent/view/40583)  The information provided on this website is intended exclusively for informational purposes and should not be construed as an offer of services. This site is managed by a RERA authorized real estate agent namely Digipace Consulting (OPC) Private Limited (Registered Agent bearing RERA No: A51700026634).\n\nThis website is a digital promotional showcase managed by\n\n#### **Digipace Consulting (OPC) Private Limited**,\n\nan independent, MahaRERA-registered real estate agent bearing\n\n#### **MahaRERA Real Estate Agent Registration No. A51700026634**.\n\nThe project showcased herein, **Runwal Malabar Hill**, is a registered real estate project developed by **Runwal Realty**, bearing **MahaRERA Project Registration Number:** PR1170002502441. All project-related particulars, including specifications, configurations, dynamic floor plans, and layout designs, are provided for consumer awareness and initial guidancee.\n\nThe text, representations, layout diagrams, and computer-generated mockups or images used on this portal are artist impressions and are indicative only. The final terms, pricing structure, dynamic stock availability, and specific project timelines are subject to change as per the promoter/developer’s updates or market modifications. In strict alignment with the Real Estate (Regulation and Development) Act, 2016 (RERA), all buyers are encouraged to independently verify all verified files, sanctioned building plans, and project progress statuses on the official MahaRERA website at <https://maharera.maharashtra.gov.in> under the registered project number before making any booking or financial commitment.\n\nDigipace Consulting (OPC) Private Limited functions purely as an authorized sourcing/facilitating partner and shall not be held liable for any unilateral alterations made by the developer to the underlying layout or project construct.","images":[]},{"url":"https://www.mumbaipropertyexchange.com/project/sambhav-walkeshwar/30323","title":"Sambhav, Walkeshwar — Price, Possession & RERA | MPE","raw_content":"[![Mumbai Property Exchange](/static/images/logo.png)](/)\n[List Property](/list-property)[WhatsApp](https://wa.me/919820067525)\n\n[New Projects](/projects-new-homes)[🗺️ Projects Map](/projects-map)[Buy a Flat](/apartments-flats-house/sale/all-locations)[Rent a Flat](/apartments-flats-house/rent/all-locations)[Commercial](/commercial-office-premises/sale/all-locations)[Builders & Developers](/builders)[Why Us](/why-us)[RERA Search](/rera-search)[Localities](/locations)[Tools & Calculators](/tools/budget-planner)[NRI Hub](/nri-hub)[News](/news)[+ List Your Property](/list-property)[💬 WhatsApp Us](https://wa.me/919820067525)\n\nMumbai property advisory & dataOperating since 1995✓ MahaRERA A51800043517Source-labelled project dataWe reply in minutes on WhatsApp\n\n![Sambhav](https://www.mumbaipropertyexchange.com/img/projects/30323/main.webp)✓ MahaRERA P51900025024RERA: no litigation reported\n\n# Sambhav\n\nHelictite Residency\n\n📍 Walkeshwar, Mumbai City · 400006\n\nCertificate Signed\n\n**Primary inventory recorded**\n\nAsk an advisor to verify current developer inventory and price.\n\nSource stage: Under Construction · mapped resale: 0 · mapped rental: 0 · primary status: recorded\n\ni\n\n## Overview\n\nSambhav is a 20 storied Under Construction Project and the location is Krishanaraj Society, Malabar Hill, Walkeshwar and is developed by NHP Developer. Sambhav was launched in and the possession of the same is likely to be in Dec 2028. Sambhav is RERA approved has the Registration Number bearing P51900025024. Sambhav is tagged as RERA Approved. Sambhav has Configurations. Amenities like Air Conditioned Lobby High speed elevators Grand entrance lobby Aluminium Sliding Windows POP finished walls Granite Platform Security Help Desk Reception Desk are planned to be provided in Sambhav.NHP Developer also has other under construction and ready possession and sold out projects like Anshul Heights, Sudhanshu, Sambhav. The property prices in Walkeshwar are in the range of 66500 to 74000 for Outright for ready and under construction\n\n₹\n\n## Price vs Locality\n\n₹100,000\n\n/sqft · locality avg **₹120,000**\n\n17% below avg\n\n₹\n\n## Walkeshwar — resale, rent & yield\n\nResale\n\n₹71,969/sqft\n\nmedian · 19 listings\n\nRent\n\n₹195.2/sqft/mo\n\n2 BHK ~₹210,000/mo\n\nGross yield\n\n3.3%/yr\n\nrent vs resale value\n\nThis project is quoted around **₹100,000/sqft** — **39% above** resale here.\n\nFrom MPE live listings, last 18 months · [Mumbai price index ›](/mumbai-property-price-index)\n\n01\n\n## Possession Timeline\n\nProposed\n\nDec 2028\n\nStatus\n\nNew\n\n02\n\n## Unit Configurations (per MahaRERA)\n\nConfigurationCarpetIndicative Price\n\n2 BHK750 ft²₹7.5 Cr\n\n2.5 BHK914 ft²₹9.14 Cr\n\n4 BHK1,221 ft²₹12.21 Cr\n\n4 BHK Sale Duplex1,496 ft²₹14.96 Cr\n\nConfigurations & carpet per MahaRERA filing · indicative price = locality rate × carpet (not the developer's quote).\n\n[💬 Verify current inventory with an advisor](https://wa.me/919820067525?text=I%20am%20looking%20to%20buy%20a%20home%20in%20Project%20Sambhav%20(RERA%20P51900025024))\n\n03\n\n## RERA Trust Record\n\nMahaRERA No.\n\nP51900025024\n\nRegistered\n\n2021-09-08\n\nLitigation\n\nNo reported in source\n\nEscrow Bank\n\n—\n\nArchitect\n\nAakar Architects & Consultants\n\nTotal FSI\n\n4077\n\n04\n\n## Buildings · 1 Wing(s)\n\nSambhav43 floors · 13 units\n\n05\n\n## Land DNA · Genesis\n\n**Redevelopment / SRA / MHADA / MMRDA / Freehold** — provenance from MPE's verification layer. The genesis no portal shows.\n\n06\n\n## Location\n\n📍 Walkeshwar  \n18.947284217647460,72.794831967829140\n\n▸ Explore map & Street View — for verified buyers\n\n07\n\n## Promoter & Professionals\n\nHelictite Residency Private LimitedNA\n\n08\n\n## Availability & Pricing\n\nTypeCarpetPriceAv