vs 30 Little GibbsWalkeshwar](/compare/sambhav-walkeshwar-vs-30-little-gibbs-walkeshwar/30323-33603)\n\n15\n\n## MahaRERA projects nearby in Walkeshwar\n\n[W291](/maharera-project/w291/P51900080495)\n\n?\n\n## Frequently Asked Questions\n\nWhen is possession of Sambhav?\n\nAs per MahaRERA, proposed possession is Dec 2028.\n\nIs Sambhav RERA-registered?\n\nYes — MahaRERA registration P51900025024, registered 2021-09-08. The current MahaRERA source record reports no litigations.\n\nWhat configurations and prices are available?\n\n3 configuration(s), including 3 BHK of 945 sqft at ₹9.45 Cr. See the pricing table above.\n\nWho is the developer?\n\nHelictite Residency\n\nHow do I book or get more details?\n\nTap WhatsApp or Call below to speak with a Mumbai Property Exchange advisor — serving Mumbai since 1995 · RERA-registered since 2017.\n\nSOURCE · MAHARERA + MUMBAI PROPERTY EXCHANGE  \nINDEPENDENT DATA · RERA A51800043517 · EST. 1995\n\n[WhatsApp](https://wa.me/919820067525?text=I%20am%20looking%20to%20buy%20a%20home%20in%20Project%20Sambhav%20(RERA%20P51900025024))[Enquire ▸](https://wa.me/919820067525?text=I%20am%20looking%20to%20buy%20a%20home%20in%20Project%20Sambhav%20(RERA%20P51900025024))\n\n🎯 AI Matchmaker\n\nTell us what you want in Walkeshwar — get matched\n\nRERA-verified options on WhatsApp. No spam, no fakes.\n\n[New launch\n\nAkshar Elevate, Vashi\n\nNew launch in Vashi — ₹28,895/sq.ft\n\nView project ›](/ad-click/900045)\n\n## 📰 Latest Mumbai Property News\n\n[View all news →](/news)\n\n[![Dhuleva Plans ₹1,000 Crore Redevelopment Near Marine Lines](https://www.mumbaipropertyexchange.com/img/news/8ab151e7dd57.png)\n\nArticles\n\nDhuleva Plans ₹1,000 Crore Redevelopment Near Marine Lines\n\n📅 28 Sep 2026](/news/2001893/dhuleva-plans-1-000-crore-redevelopment-near-marine-lines)[![Mumbai MMR Targets $1.5 Trillion Economy by 2047](https://www.mumbaipropertyexchange.com/img/news/1db71ca6a520.jpg)\n\nArticles\n\nMumbai MMR Targets $1.5 Trillion Economy by 2047\n\n📅 04 Sep 2026](/news/2001923/mumbai-mmr-targets-1-5-trillion-economy-by-2047)[![HC Clears Development of 48-Acre Swadeshi Mills Land in Mumbai](https://www.mumbaipropertyexchange.com/img/news/0445cfc31f2f.jpg)\n\nArticles\n\nHC Clears Development of 48-Acre Swadeshi Mills Land in Mumbai\n\n📅 04 Sep 2026](/news/2001910/hc-clears-development-of-48-acre-swadeshi-mills-land-in-mumbai)[![Kamdhenu Realities Buys 4-Acre Navi Mumbai Land for ₹150 Crore](https://www.mumbaipropertyexchange.com/img/news/06ac4371a40f.jpg)\n\nArticles\n\nKamdhenu Realities Buys 4-Acre Navi Mumbai Land for ₹150 Crore\n\n📅 01 Sep 2026](/news/2001905/kamdhenu-realities-buys-4-acre-navi-mumbai-land-for-150-crore)","images":[]},{"url":"https://houssed.com/mumbai/sambhav-group/sambhav-terraces-127354","title":"Sambhav Terraces, Malabar Hill, Mumbai | 3 BHK Ultra Luxury Apartments | Houssed","raw_content":"[Connect Now](https://api.whatsapp.com/send/?phone=918169114718&text=Hi%2C+I%27m+looking+to+Buy+a+residential+property+in+Mumbai.+Please+connect+with+me.+Thanks%21&type=phone_number&app_absent=0)\n\nNew Launch  Ultra Luxury\n\nNew Launch  Ultra Luxury\n\nNew Launch  Ultra Luxury\n\nNew Launch  Ultra Luxury\n\nNew Launch  Ultra Luxury\n\n## Project Overview of Sambhav Terraces Malabar Hill, Mumbai\n\n---\n\nProject Status\n\nNew Launch\n\nNo. of Units\n\n56 Units\n\nProject Area\n\n0.23 Acres\n\nTowers / Floors\n\n1 Towers / 22 Floors\n\nProperty View\n\nOpen View\n\nTwo Wheeler, Four Wheeler\n\n---\n\nTerrace, nestled in the prime locale of Forjett Hill, Mumbai, is a landmark residential development that embodies the rich legacy of Indian architecture with a modern urban edge. Showcasing stunning craftsmanship, a distinctive wooden-inspired façade, and intricate green design, the project redefines luxury living. It’s more than just a structure—it’s a celebration of elegance and thoughtful architecture that harmonizes with nature and city life alike.  \n  \nThis 22-storey marvel offers meticulously designed 2BHK, 3BHK, and 5BHK residences, each crafted for comfort and luxury. Every unit features expansive balcony spaces that mirror the essence of a terrace—breezy, spacious, and scenic. These unique balcony-terraces open to breathtaking views of the Mumbai skyline, allowing residents to indulge in tranquil mornings and vibrant evenings amidst nature and city lights.  \n  \nSet in one of the greenest and most desirable locales of South Mumbai, Terrace presents not just a home, but a curated lifestyle. From lush surroundings to architectural finesse, every moment here is designed to inspire and elevate the living experience for its discerning residents.\n\n## Floor Plans & Pricing of Sambhav Terraces Malabar Hill, Mumbai\n\n---\n\n2 BHK Flat\n\nCarpet Area\n\n825 Sq Ft\n\nPrice\n\n5.35 Cr\n\n3 BHK Flat\n\nCarpet Area\n\n1079 Sq Ft\n\nPrice\n\n7 Cr\n\n3 BHK Flat\n\nCarpet Area\n\n1249 Sq Ft\n\nPrice\n\n8.1 Cr\n\n5 BHK Flat\n\nCarpet Area\n\n1997 Sq Ft\n\nPrice\n\n12.96 Cr\n\n5 BHK Flat\n\nCarpet Area\n\n2493 Sq Ft\n\nPrice\n\n16.18 Cr\n\nFloor Plan\n\n## Key Features of Sambhav Terraces Malabar Hill, Mumbai\n\n---\n\n* Luxurious Homes.\n* Prime Location.\n* Green Surroundings.\n* Well-Ventilated Interiors.\n* Panoramic Views.\n* Comfort & Luxury.\n\n## Amenities Sambhav Terraces Malabar Hill, Mumbai\n\n---\n\n* 24X7 Water Supply\n* Fire Fighting System\n* Lift\n* Security\n* Visitor Parking\n* Mud Playing Zone\n* Pets Zone\n* Children Playing Zone\n* Senior Citizen Sitting Area\n* Dth And Broadband Connection\n* Senior Citizens Walking Track\n* Society Office\n* Convenience Store\n\n* Reserved Parking\n* Cctv Surveillance\n* Entrance Gate With Security\n* Fire Fighting System\n* Fireplace\n\n* Kids Play Area\n* Lattu Game\n* Game Corners\n* Indoor Games\n* Multipurpose Play Court\n* Carrom\n\n* Community Club\n* Recreation/Kids Club\n* Indoor Kids' Play Area\n* Indoor Games And Activities\n* Gym\n* Kids Pool\n* Nature Walkway\n* Green Wall\n\n* Mo Sewage Treatment Plant\n* Organic Waste Convertor\n* Eco Life\n* Drip Irrigation System\n\n* Marble flooring\n* Laminate finish doors\n* Premium sanitary and CP fittings\n* Vitrified tile flooring\n* Stainless steel sink\n* False Ceiling\n* Concealed Electrification\n* TV Point\n* Telephone point\n* Acrylic Emulsion Paint\n* Concealed Plumbing\n* Multi-stranded cables\n* Concealed Drainage System\n* Geyser Point\n\n## Google Map Location of Sambhav Terraces Malabar Hill\n\n## Locality Overview of Malabar Hill, Mumbai\n\n---\n\n[Malabar Hill](/location-review/mumbai/malabar-hill-real-estate-guide) is a fast-developing residential area in Mumbai, preferred for its open surroundings and improving connectivity. The locality offers access to daily conveniences such as schools, healthcare facilities, and retail options within the broader Malabar Hill region.\n\nWith increasing residential development and infrastructure growth, Malabar Hill is often considered by buyers looking for affordable housing and long-term value.\n\n## RERA QR codes\n\n---\n\nSambhav Terraces is a real estate project registered under Maharashtra Real Estate Regulatory Authority, ensuring transparency and accountability in its development. Scan the RERA QR code or search for the project here: <https://maharera.maharashtra.gov.in/>\n\n---\n\nRera No.:  [P51900052101](https://maharera.maharashtra.gov.in/projects-search-result?certificate_no=P51900052101)\n\nProject: Sambhav Terraces\n\n## Explore Neighbourhood Sambhav Terraces Malabar Hill\n\n---\n\n* Cafe Coffee Day\n* Vijay Sagar Pure Veg\n* Paramount Cafe\n* The Cantonese Kitchen\n\n* The Modern School\n* Hill Spring International School\n* Aditya Birla World Academy\n* Maharashtra College\n\n* Cutis Skin Studio\n* Cumballa Hill Hospital and Heart Institute\n* St Elizabeth's Hospital\n* Saifee Hospital\n\n* Habit Shopping center\n* Cosmos Fashion\n* Heera Panna Shopping Center\n* Colaba Causeway\n\n## [Sambhav Group](/mumbai/sale/builder/sambhav-group-724)\n\nOngoing Projects: 7\n\nCompleted Projects: 5\n\nTotal Projects: 12\n\n---\n\nFounded in 1988, the Sambhav group came into the picture, blending modernity, comfort, and heritage all together to develop creative homes.   \nThey take into consideration analytics, design, investments, as well as construction, and finance. Sambhav’s accomplishments lie in re-development, construction, and even acquisition, showcasing their presence throughout Mumbai. The company strongly believes in maintaining the essence of the history of Mumbai, and building heritage development, soaked in luxury ad modernity.  \nThey have built projects like The Primordial House, an ongoing project, and other prestigious development. They aim to contribute to and elevate the city's space with beauty and excellence.  \n  \n  \n[Properties in Mumbai by Sambhav Group](https://houssed.com/mumbai/sale/builder/sambhav-group-724)\n\n## About Sambhav Terraces, Mumbai, Malabar Hill\n\n---\n\n[Sambhav Terraces](https://houssed.com/mumbai/sambhav-group/sambhav-terraces-127354), Malabar Hill, is a location shaped by long-held homes, guarded privacy, and land values built over generations rather than sales cycles. It's a 22-storey residential tower that redefines luxury living in South Mumbai. The project offers thoughtfully designed 2 BHK, 3 BHK, and expansive 5 BHK residences, each designed with a strong focus on space, light, and everyday comfort.\n\n## 1. Why Do Ultra-Luxury Buyers Prefer Sambhav Terraces?\n\nMalabar Hill is one of Mumbai’s most stable residential zones. It has a limited land supply, strict development norms, and a resident profile that has remained consistent for decades. It has a limited land supply, strict development norms, and a resident profile that has remained consistent for decades.\n\nSambhav Terraces benefits from this reliability. The project is located within a low-density environment, surrounded by established residences, which keeps noise levels low, traffic manageable, and the overall living experience calm by Mumbai standards.\n\n## 2. The Neighbourhood & Surroundings\n\nMalabar Hill’s greatest luxury is its location. Marine Drive, Nariman Point, Charni Road, and Girgaon are all within a short driving distance. Daily travel remains predictable because the area does not attract sudden traffic or office crowds.\n\nWithin minutes, residents can access high-end cafes, fine-dining restaurants, boutique bars, exclusive clubs, and private social venues. This allows homeowners to enjoy quiet mornings and chaotic evenings without long commutes.\n\n### Connectivity and Travel\n\n* Close access to Marine Drive, Walkeshwar Road, and Peddar Road\n* Smooth connectivity to Nariman Point, Churchgate, Lower Parel, and BKC via arterial routes\n* Reasonable access to Western Express Highway through South Mumbai corridors\n* Established road infrastructure with minimal disruption from large transit projects\n\nFor daily movement, residents rely more on short drives than long commutes. This reduces travel stress and supports a more predictable lifestyle.\n\n### Essential Services Nearby\n\n* Reputed schools and international curriculum institutions\n* Leading hospitals such as Jaslok and Apollo hospital\n* Banks, private clinics, and premium retail outlets\n* Daily convenience stores, pharmacies, and home service providers\n\n## 3. Local Real Estate Market Performance\n\n* Limited new supply due to land scarcity and strict approvals\n* Stable pricing with slow but consistent appreciation\n* Low distress sales and minimal inventory overhang\n* Strong resale value for quality developments\n\n## 3. Rapid Infrastructure Development\n\n### Micro-Local Happenings That Affect Property Value\n\nWhile Malabar Hill does not see large-scale infrastructure announcements, smaller civic upgrades play a quiet but important role.\n\nThese include:\n\n* Road resurfacing and traffic flow improvements\n* Beautification of heritage zones and public spaces\n* Utility upgrades for water supply and underground cabling\n* Improved security and civic monitoring\n\n### Cafes, Fine Dining, and Social Lounges\n\n* Fine dining restaurants with legacy value\n* Quiet cafes and bakeries\n* Private clubs and social spaces\n* Proximity to Colaba and Fort\n\n### Lifestyle Amenities in and Around the Area\n\n* High-end fitness studios and private gyms\n* Spas, wellness clinics, and personal trainers\n* Select pubs and lounges that focus on exclusivity\n* Premium residential amenities such as private pools, fitness clubs, spas, and sauna rooms within newer developments\n\n## 4. Notable Landmarks\n\n* Hanging Gardens and Kamala Nehru Park\n* Walkeshwar Temple and Banganga Tank\n* Babulnath Temple\n* Marine Drive and Girgaon Chowpatty\n* Nariman Point business district\n* Charni Road and Churchgate railway stations\n\n## 5. The Builder Profile: Praman Developers\n\nPraman Developers has established a trust for quality and elegance in Mumbai’s luxury residential sector. With three ongoing projects and a focus on thoughtful design, the developer emphasizes skilled labor, timely delivery, and premium finishes. Their work reflects a dedication to creating homes that offer elegance and functionality, catering to discerning buyers who expect nothing less than excellence.\n\n## 6. Is Sambhav Terraces Worth Investing In?\n\nThe project appeals to a specific investment profile. It suits investors who value stability, brand protection, and long-term appreciation.\n\n### Rental Yield Potential\n\nKey tenant profiles include:\n\n* Senior corporate leaders\n* Diplomats and consulate-linked professionals\n* Business families seeking long-term rentals\n* Expats looking for quiet South Mumbai addresses\n\nWhile yields may not match commercial hotspots, vacancy risk remains low for well-maintained luxury units.\n\n### Long-Term Appreciation\n\n* Near-zero land availability\n* Controlled redevelopment supply\n* Continued preference for South Mumbai among HNIs\n* Strong resale demand for branded luxury projects\n\nOver a long holding period, such assets tend to outperform volatile micro-markets.\n\n### Micro-Market Stability\n\nIt's less affected by:\n\n* Infrastructure delays\n* Oversupply\n* Rental volatility\n* Speculative pricing\n\n### Demand Drivers Around the Area\n\n* Proximity to South Mumbai business districts\n* Established social and civic infrastructure\n* Limited luxury housing options\n* Preference for low-density living\n\n## Final Thoughts\n\nSambhav Terraces caters to buyers and investors who are aware of South Mumbai’s old luxury rules. Location first & privacy always. For homebuyers, it offers a quiet, established neighborhood with modern comforts layered carefully on top. For investors, it provides a low-risk entry into one of Mumbai’s most defensible micro-markets.\n\n## FAQ's about Sambhav Terraces Malabar Hill, Mumbai\n\n---\n\n## Popular Real Estate Searches\n\n### Browse Homes in Malabar Hill\n\n* [Luxury Homes in Malabar Hill](/mumbai-malabar.hill/sale/flats/segment/luxury)\n* [Ultra Luxury Homes in Malabar Hill](/mumbai-malabar.hill/sale/flats/segment/ultra-luxury)\n\n### Discover Homes in Malabar Hill\n\n* [Apartments in Malabar Hill](/mumbai-malabar.hill/sale/flats/property/flat)\n* [Duplex in Malabar Hill](/mumbai-malabar.hill/sale/flats/property/duplex)\n\n### Explore Projects in Malabar Hill\n\n* [New Projects in Malabar Hill](/mumbai-malabar.hill/sale/flats/possession/new-projects)\n* [Ready To Move Projects in Malabar Hill](/mumbai-malabar.hill/sale/flats/possession/ready-to-move)\n\n### Homes by BHK in Malabar Hill\n\n* [2BHK Homes in Malabar Hill](/mumbai-malabar.hill/sale/flats/2bhk)\n* [3BHK Homes in Malabar Hill](/mumbai-malabar.hill/sale/flats/3bhk)\n* [4+ BHK Homes in Malabar Hill](/mumbai-malabar.hill/sale/flats/4-plus-bhk)\n* [4BHK Homes in Malabar Hill](/mumbai-malabar.hill/sale/flats/4bhk)\n\n### Homes by Budget in Malabar Hill\n\n* [Homes in Malabar Hill Above 5 Cr](/mumbai-malabar.hill/sale/flats/budget/above-5-cr)\n\n### Homes by View in Malabar Hill\n\n* [Open View Homes in Malabar Hill](/mumbai-malabar.hill/sale/flats/property-view/open-view)\n* [Sea View Homes in Malabar Hill](/mumbai-malabar.hill/sale/flats/property-view/sea-view)\n\n### Explore Nearby Localities\n\n* [Homes in Breach Candy](/mumbai-breach.candy/sale/flats)\n* [Homes in Malabar Hill](/mumbai-malabar.hill/sale/flats)\n* [Homes in Walkeshwar](/mumbai-walkeshwar/sale/flats)\n\n ","images":[]},{"url":"https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/buy/new/suparshva-w291-project-malabar-hill-mumbai/3595","title":"Suparshva W291 Malabar Hill | Latest Price, Floor Plans & Brochure","raw_content":"![](https://www.facebook.com/tr?id=1944469116304081&ev=PageView&noscript=1)\n![](https://www.facebook.com/tr?id=2462545180935377&ev=PageView&noscript=1)\n![keystonerealestateadvisory.com](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/public/img/gallery/ks-logo.webp)\n\n# Suparshva W291\n\n![Suparshva W291 Project Images 1](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/public/uploads/property/5Sdcgfy0LiLFLXn1Cf6BEePp1HRC2V4oQUoNgE0T.webp)\n\n## Suparshva W291\n\nBy Suparshva Incorporation\n, Malabar Hill, Mumbai\n\nPrice On Request\n\n## About Suparshva W291\n\n![Land Parcel](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/public/img/Group 2074.png)\n![No Of Storeys](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/public/img/ph_building-bold.png)\n![Possession Date](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/public/img/solar_calendar-linear.png)\n![Possession Status](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/public/img/fluent-emoji-high-contrast_building-construction.png)\n![Location](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/public/img/akar-icons_location.png)\n![Rera No](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/public/img/mdi_court-hammer.png)\n\n### Introduction\n\nFor a Suparshva Incorporation project, Call Us Today! And for Suparshva W291 project details, check out the description below.\n\n**Address:**  \nLocated in Malabar Hill, Mumbai, Suparshva W291 is positioned in one of South Mumbai’s most prestigious and elite residential neighbourhoods. This prime address is known for its scenic surroundings, heritage charm, and proximity to key commercial zones, reputed educational institutions, healthcare facilities, premium retail destinations, and seamless road connectivity, making it an ideal choice for refined city living.\n\n**Project Details:**  \nSuparshva W291 is developed on an approximate land parcel of 0.46 acres  \nSuparshva W291 features a premium residential tower with 22 storeys  \nSuparshva W291 offers well-planned 1 BHK and 2 BHK apartments  \nSuparshva W291 is designed to optimise space with efficient and practical layouts  \nSuparshva W291 focuses on comfortable homes suited for urban lifestyles in South Mumbai\n\n**Carpet Area:**  \nSuparshva W291 carpet area details are given below:  \n1 BHK - 490 sq.ft.  \n2 BHK - 705 sq.ft. to 813 sq.ft.\n\n**Lifestyle Amenities:**  \nJogging Track  \nKids Play Area\n\n**Facilities:**  \nLift  \nPower Back Up  \nParking Facility  \n24\\*7 Water Supply  \nGated Society  \nSecurity System\n\n**Why to Invest in this Property?**  \nExclusive Malabar Hill location with high prestige value  \nLimited new residential developments in South Mumbai  \nExcellent connectivity to key business and lifestyle hubs  \nTrusted developer with an established market presence  \nStrong long-term appreciation and rental demand potential\n\n**Possession & RERA:**  \nPossession Date: December 2031  \nMahaRERA Registration Number: P51900080495\n\n## Pricing of Suparshva W291\n\n![](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/public/img/layout-300.webp)\n\n### LAYOUT\n\n#### 1 BHK\n\nCarpet Area   \n**490 sqft**\n\nOn Request\n\n![](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/public/img/layout-300.webp)\n\n### LAYOUT\n\n#### 2 BHK\n\nCarpet Area   \n**705 sqft**\n\nOn Request\n\n![](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/public/img/layout-300.webp)\n\n### LAYOUT\n\n#### 2 BHK\n\nCarpet Area   \n**813 sqft**\n\nOn Request\n\n## Property Features of Suparshva W291\n\n### Amenities\n\n![Jogging Track](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/public/uploads/amenity/0MdcVu1dWQscKGxYPlOEvfKZG17sbpLwkkWHGQus.webp)\n![Kids Play Area](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/public/uploads/amenity/caC1nd4EG3aPxrSHSy42KOuI69993uXqnhmO5wM1.webp)\n\n### Facilities\n\n![Lift](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/public/uploads/amenity/PlsX6Ye4mz30wZTyU2HUzRfZZAF1UyAfAPcv7UW6.webp)\n![Power Back Up](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/public/uploads/amenity/hyhD5ZsEryAKGW3ZBDuJfwfIbR00KY59KGRA3TdM.webp)\n![Parking](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/public/uploads/amenity/Mn1Br3z95nMIVacp1Oa7MFHiuII6ZjpgFaetLKCL.webp)\n![24*7 Water](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/public/uploads/amenity/8r8bjKftbO1sSY8rBawv8AexZBpGB5Yes5BaCx4g.png)\n![Gated Society](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/public/uploads/amenity/dDrSaKbMFrQab5ychFhoq4q88iDVDHgsAU0z9gxn.webp)\n\n## Location of Suparshva W291\n\nExperience location of Suparshva W291 from the comfort of your home\n\n### About Malabar Hill\n\nThe most exclusive and expensive residential address in India, Malabar Hill is home to top politicians, industrialists, and celebrities. It offers panoramic views of the Back Bay and the Queen’s Necklace. Highlights include the Hanging Gardens, the Kamala Nehru Park, and the historic Banganga Tank. It is a quiet, leafy, and highly secure enclave that represents the pinnacle of Mumbai’s social and financial hierarchy.\n\n**Malabar Hill Location Offers Proximity To:**\n\nCharni Road\n\nGrant Road\n\nMaheshwari Devi Temple\n\nMumbai Central\n\nMarine Lines Railway station\n\nMalbar Hill Police Station Bus Stop\n\n**Popular Landmarks in Malabar Hill**\n\nSardar Pav Bhaji\n\nHaji Ali Juice Centre\n\nShalimar Restaurant\n\nSukh Sagar\n\nPizza By The Bay\n\n**Schools and Colleges in Malabar Hill**\n\nWalsingham House School\n\nORCHIDS The International School - CBSE School in Masjid\n\nAditya Birla World Academy\n\nVilla Theresa High School\n\nBhavans College\n\n**Hospitals in Malabar Hill**\n\nSir H. N. Reliance Foundation Hospital and Research Centre\n\nJaslok Hospital & Research Centre\n\nNarayana Health SRCC Children's Hospital\n\nWockhardt Hospitals, Mumbai Central\n\nDr. Manish S Shah Clinic | Unit of Dr Agarwals Eye Hospital\n\n**Shopping and Entertainment in Malabar Hill**\n\nCR2 Shopping Mall\n\nCity Centre Mumbai\n\nRubberwala The Platinum Mall\n\nBharat Bazar Mall\n\n## Suparshva W291 Brochure\n\n![Suparshva W291 brochure](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/public/uploads/property/5Sdcgfy0LiLFLXn1Cf6BEePp1HRC2V4oQUoNgE0T.webp)\n\n## Video of Suparshva W291\n\n![Suparshva W291](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/public/img/csp.webp)\n\n## Bank Offers\n\n![About Keystone Real Estate Advisory](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/public/ks/images/home-loan-banner-700.webp)\n![Aditya Birla Capital](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/public/uploads/banklogos/XGrM42hFHDybp1Y19862M4OyJ8gDOsg3EE9GTEB1.webp)\n![Axis Bank Home Loan](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/public/uploads/banklogos/QZdtxvhynBtBOc30oXZBnWVc5XQBY2AurKebGOt2.webp)\n![Bajaj Finserv](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/public/uploads/banklogos/AXQcBE3UdCXzDqCrUfdYix4bnsRarkLpNFpY10H8.webp)\n![Bank of Baroda](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/public/uploads/banklogos/6MLWA1aTbSguKjxxqZVVnPer7FyazH85YXJv5wKD.webp)\n![Citi Bank](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/public/uploads/banklogos/LHciFR3ExZu3X7BihADb9fpp2Z3Di0ilFvyjptMj.webp)\n![HDFC Home Loans](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/public/uploads/banklogos/k3SCEAb5zwzavNb1Y4gZHIIQ3BcUHxpxXR91uXrP.webp)\n![ICICI Bank](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/public/uploads/banklogos/dqWrCKj6YqYmSpdnc40KNaPQPIv9Bf22dDHhDJiq.webp)\n![LIC Housing Finanace](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/public/uploads/banklogos/ka0moGXIt4v3z8y16KQ8ruJG3F4rd40bQOManwKw.webp)\n![PNB Housing](h